## Data (everything under `data/`)

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

The dataset is derived from port operations statistics published by the
Brazilian National Waterway Transportation Agency (ANTAQ) and from
meteorological series provided by EPAGRI/CIRAM. Attribution to those sources
should be preserved in derived works. The original station-level meteorological
series are not redistributed here; see `data/README.md`.
